Tuffex (`@talex-touch/tuffex`) is the Vue 3 component library behind CoreBox, plugin surfaces, and this documentation site.

## Concepts

| Page | Covers |
|------|--------|
| [Installation](./installation.en.mdc) | Three import paths and their stylesheets |
| [Design Foundations](./foundations.en.mdc) | G2 curvature, refraction shaders, dark optics, 13-14px typography, and token matrix |
| [Design Concepts Manual](../concepts/index.en.mdc) | 18 in-depth topics: physical curvature, dispersion shaders, micro-motion, and anti-jitter |
| [Theming](./theming.en.mdc) | Token overrides, dark mode, high contrast |
| [Icons](./icons.en.mdc) | How `TxIcon` resolves and loads icons |
| [Accessibility](./accessibility.en.mdc) | Focus, motion, contrast and ARIA conventions |
| [Utils](./utils.en.mdc) | Stacking, toast, dialog and animation helpers |
| [Sound](./sound.en.mdc) | Synthesized feedback sounds, off by default |
| [Component Changelog](./changelog.en.mdc) | Release history and since index |

