---
code: |
  <template>
    <TxButton variant="primary" size="sm" icon="i-carbon-rocket">Deploy</TxButton>
    <TuffInput v-model="query" placeholder="Search tasks" prefix-icon="i-carbon-search" clearable />
    <TuffSwitch v-model="automationEnabled" />
    <TxProgressBar :percentage="84" status="success" show-text />
    <TxStatusBadge text="Reviewing" status="warning" />
    <TxDataTable v-model:selected-keys="selectedKeys" :columns="columns" :data="rows" row-key="id" selectable />
  </template>
---
::

## Tutorial Path

- Start with [Composing Tuffex interfaces](../getting-started/tuffex-composition.en.mdc): split a page into actions → status → data.
- On list pages, `TxSearchInput`, `TxSearchSelect` and `TxSearchEmpty` carry search and no-match recovery; `TxDataTable` + `TxPagination` carry the data.
- Design loading, empty and error states together: `TxLoadingState`, `TxEmptyState`, `TxErrorState`.
- Compose dashboards from `TxDataTable`, `TxStatusBadge`, `TxProgressBar` and charts, not one-off SVG or status UI; settings pages use `TxTabs` for sections and `TxDrawer` for dense configuration.

## Migration Dashboard

`Verified`: manually reviewed; `Migrated`: AI-migrated, worth checking against source; `In progress` / `Not migrated`: demos and API may still change. The sidebar flags only pages that still need attention.

